THIRD-PARTY METHOD ATTRIBUTION

The offline dice-to-BIP39 method demonstrated by this educational website
(odd/even bit mapping, paper calculator workflow, and last-word candidate
enumeration) was published by veebch:

  https://github.com/veebch/Bip39-Dice
  License: GPL-3.0

veebch credits the 24th-word Python logic to avsync/bip39chk:
  https://github.com/avsync/bip39chk

The BIP-39 English wordlist is from:
  https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt

This website is an independent educational UI. It is not affiliated with
veebch, Coinkite, or COLDCARD. For real fund-bearing seeds, use offline
tools such as veebch/Bip39-Dice on an air-gapped machine.
